## LangChain4j (MCP client + Skills loader)

The daemon uses LangChain4j artifacts for the local MCP client
(`langchain4j-mcp` and its `langchain4j`, `langchain4j-core`,
`langchain4j-http-client`, `langchain4j-http-client-jdk` dependencies) and for
skill discovery (`langchain4j-skills`, with `commonmark` /
`commonmark-ext-yaml-front-matter`). Additionally the MCP client uses the
OkHttp 4.x family (`okhttp` 4.12.0, `okhttp-sse` 4.12.0).

